      "role": "user",
      "content": "so if it's not a guarantee and it's just a rare thing with serotonin, is it really that big of a deal? i'm just worried about my mood and the serotonin syndrome thing sounds super unlikely since i'm not on antidepressants. i just want to know if the pill will still work. like, will the st johns wort make the birth control less effective or something? i've heard people say it might, but i want a straight answer.",
